<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Coding Club — Home</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">DevClub</a>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="index.html" class="active">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#events">Events</a></li>
                <li><a href="#members">Members</a></li>
                <li><a href="#join">Join Us</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
        <h1>Building the Future, One Line at a Time</h1>
        <p>Welcome to the premier college community for developers, designers, and tech enthusiasts.</p>
        <a href="#join" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
    </header>

    <main class="main-content">
        
        <!-- Events Section (Table Showcase) -->
        <section id="events" class="section">
            <h2 class="section-title">Upcoming Club Schedules</h2>
            <div class="table-responsive">
                <table class="club-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Event Name</th>
                            <th>Date</th>
                            <th>Location</th>
                            <th>Status</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Hackathon 2026</td>
                            <td>Nov 12, 2026</td>
                            <td>Lab 3C</td>
                            <td><span class="badge badge-open">Open</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>UI/UX Workshop</td>
                            <td>Nov 18, 2026</td>
                            <td>Seminar Hall</td>
                            <td><span class="badge badge-open">Open</span></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>AI Tech Talk</td>
                            <td>Dec 05, 2026</td>
                            <td>Main Auditorium</td>
                            <td><span class="badge badge-full">Full</span></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Form Section -->
        <section id="join" class="section">
            <div class="form-container">
                <h2 class="section-title">Membership Application</h2>
                <form class="club-form">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">Full Name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" required placeholder="John Doe">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">College Email</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" required placeholder="johndoe@college.edu">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="track">Preferred Track</label>
                        <select id="track">
                            <option>Web Development</option>
                            <option>Mobile Apps</option>
                            <option>Data Science & AI</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Submit Application</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2026 College DevClub. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>








/* ==========================================
   DESIGN VARIABLES
   ========================================== */
:root {
    /* Color Palette */
    --primary: #4f46e5;         /* Deep Indigo */
    --primary-hover: #4338ca;
    --secondary: #0ea5e9;       /* Light Cyan Accent */
    --bg-main: #f8fafc;         /* Slate Background */
    --bg-card: #ffffff;
    --text-dark: #0f172a;       /* Dark Typography */
    --text-muted: #475569;
    --border: #e2e8f0;
    
    /* Layout Constants */
    --radius: 8px;
    --transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

/* ==========================================
   BASE & RESET STYLES
   ========================================== */
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    background-color: var(--bg-main);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ==========================================
   NAVIGATION COMPONENT
   ========================================== */
.navbar {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
}

.nav-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
}

.nav-logo {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
}

.nav-links {
    display: flex;
    list-style: none;
    gap: 2rem;
}

.nav-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: var(--transition);
}

.nav-links a:hover, 
.nav-links a.active {
    color: var(--primary);
}

/* ==========================================
   HERO BANNER LAYOUT
   ========================================== */
.hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #312e81 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
}

.hero p {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: #c7d2fe;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
}

/* ==========================================
   STRUCTURAL CONTAINERS & HEADINGS
   ========================================== */
.main-content {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
}

.section {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.section-title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.section-title::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 50px;
    height: 4px;
    background-color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 2px;
}

/* ==========================================
   BUTTON STRUCTURAL CLASSES
   ========================================== */
.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: var(--transition);
}

.btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #ffffff;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: var(--primary-hover);
}

.btn-block {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
}

/* ==========================================
   READABLE TABLES
   ========================================== */
.table-responsive {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
}

.club-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    text-align: left;
}

.club-table th, 
.club-table td {
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.club-table th {
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
}

.club-table tbody tr:hover {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
}

.badge {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
}

.badge-open { background-color: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }
.badge-full { background-color: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }

/* ==========================================
   READABLE FORMS
   ========================================== */
.form-container {
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.form-group {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.form-group label {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
}

.form-group input,
.form-group select {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: 1rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: var(--transition);
}

.form-group input:focus,
.form-group select:focus {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
}

/* ==========================================
   FOOTER STYLING
   ========================================== */
.footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
}








This layout relies on a modern, professional indigo brand theme built out via clean CSS variable mapping [cite: 25]. Structural readable text alignment uses standard system font definitions to scale natively while improving processing performance across screen layouts [cite: 25]. Table borders deploy background row hovers to maximize visual scannability, paired with isolated inputs bounded by focus glows to anchor interactive web form clarity [cite: 25].
